BEGIN_PGML
The fraction [`\frac{21}{40}`] can be thought of as dividing the whole number [_]{21}{5} into [_]{40}{5} equal-sized parts.

END_PGML

##########
# Solution
##########

BEGIN_PGML_SOLUTION
Since [`\frac{21}{40}`] means the same as [`21\div40\text{,}`] it can be thought of as dividing [`21`] into [`40`] equal parts.

END_PGML_SOLUTION

